message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below, and cite the benchmark dataset record for the data."
type: software
title: "Dravix: formulation-to-cone-calorimeter property models and benchmark code"
version: "2.0.0"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23653502"
